OL,3,GNEWSAPlans to turn Van Morrison's
OL,4,Aformer primary into a special school
OL,5,Adelayed
OL,6,
OL,7,FA plan to turn Sir Van Morrison's old
OL,8,Fprimary school into a special school
OL,9,Fcampus has faced "unavoidable
OL,10,Fconstruction delays".
OL,12,FIt was originally hoped that the former
OL,13,FElmgrove Primary School could re-open
OL,14,Fas a special school in September 2026.
OL,16,FThe east Belfast school is right beside
OL,17,F"The Hollow", made famous in Sir Van's
OL,18,Fsong Brown Eyed Girl.
OL,20,FThe Education Authority (EA) said that
OL,21,F"as a listed building," the project was
OL,22,Fa "significant and complex scheme."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
